plan_mode: executing
plan_scope: Agent-facing OpenAPI mapping and read-only coverage classification only; no server mutation or release publication.
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Official stable 10.11.11 and preview 12.0-rc4; live 10.11.11. Five wrapper commands need exact GET mappings; two supported legacy routes are absent from official OpenAPI; setup validate is orchestration. Implementation and focused tests already pass; complete full validation, PR review, merge, and no-publish proof."
