body: "## Privacy and safety\\nCredentials, server URL, identifiers, raw schemas, and payloads stay outside Git and PM. Live execution uses JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1.\\n\\n## Quality boundary\\nThis plan improves contract correctness and measured coverage but does not close jf-mkzh unless genuine repository-wide 100/100/100/100 is achieved."
